      "special_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<ul><li>This creature cannot be targeted with<strong> melee attacks</strong> as long as it is in mid-air.</li><li>If this creature suffers damage of a type they are <strong>Vulnerable</strong> to, they lose the benefits of this Skill until the end of the round.</li><li><p>This creature may also be forced to land by spending an <strong>opportunity</strong>. As long as it is in <strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.GJevbCPM8cffm1QM]{Crisis}</strong>, it loses all benefits granted by this Skill.</p></li></ul>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "📜 Flying "
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>While this Construct is in the scene, all enemies gain the following effect:</p><ul><li><p> Afflicted with <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.NTvswy65a5N2fh09\" data-id=\"NTvswy65a5N2fh09\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\" aria-describedby=\"tooltip\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(93, 20, 43) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-image: none !important; background-position: initial !important; background-size: initial !important; background-repeat: initial !important; background-attachment: initial !important; background-origin: initial !important; background-clip: initial !important; background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; white-space: nowrap; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(25, 24, 19); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Suppress</span></strong></a></span></span></p></li><li><p><strong>Damage Type</strong> cannot be changed</p></li></ul>",
